---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: About IEEE
description: IEEE - the world's largest technical professional organization dedicated to advancing technology for the benefit of humanity.
permalink: /about-ieee/
---

<section class="section" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--ieee-blue) 8%, transparent), var(--surface))">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display: grid; gap: var(--s-7); align-items: center; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr" class="reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">About IEEE</span>
        <h1>Who We Are</h1>
        <p style="font-size: var(--fs-md)">IEEE - <strong>world's largest technical professional organization</strong> - is dedicated to advancing technology for the benefit of humanity. IEEE and its members inspire a global community through its highly cited publications, conferences, technology standards, and professional and educational activities.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--s-3); flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: var(--s-5)">
          <a href="https://ieee.org/" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Know More</a>
          <a href="https://www.ieee.org/membership-application/public/join.html?grade=Student&promo=STUJOIN" class="btn btn-ghost" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join IEEE Now</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--ieee-blue), #003f6b); border-radius: var(--r-lg); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: var(--s-8); min-height: 280px">
        <img src="/images/ieee-hyderabad-sac-logo.png" alt="IEEE Hyderabad Section" style="max-height: 180px; width: auto; filter: brightness(0) invert(1)" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">IEEE at a Glance</span>
      <h2>IEEE by the Numbers</h2>
      <p>A snapshot of the world's largest engineering and technology organization.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      {% set ieeeStats = [
        "More than 419,000 members in more than 160 countries, more than 50% of whom are from outside the United States.",
        "More than 124,000 Student members.",
        "342 Sections in ten geographic Regions worldwide.",
        "1,834 Chapters that unite local members with similar technical interests.",
        "3,422 Student Branches at colleges and universities in over 100 countries.",
        "2,600 Student Branch chapters of IEEE technical societies.",
        "568 affinity groups including Young Professionals (YP), Women in Engineering (WIE), Life Members (LM), and IEEE Entrepreneurship.",
        "39 technical Societies and seven technical councils representing the wide range of IEEE technical interests.",
        "More than 5 million documents in the IEEE Xplore® digital library, with more than 12 million downloads each month.",
        "Has more than 1,800 conferences in IEEE Xplore.",
        "Has over 1,200 active standards and more than 650 standards under development.",
        "Publishes approximately 200 transactions, journals, and magazines.",
        "Sponsors more than 1,900 conferences in 103 countries.",
        "Partnering with more than 1,400 non-IEEE entities globally.",
        "Attracting more than 547,000 conference attendees.",
        "Publishing more than 1,800 conference proceedings via IEEE Xplore."
      ] %}
      {% for stat in ieeeStats %}
        <div class="card reveal" style="padding: var(--s-5); align-items: flex-start; gap: var(--s-3)">
          <div style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: var(--r-pill); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ieee-blue) 15%, transparent); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--ieee-blue)" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: var(--fs-sm)">{{ stat }}</p>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
